=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Erlene} at {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)} (J-8) while on {p:Scholar} for a cutscene that begins the quest.
** You must zone and wait until next game day after completing On Sabbatical.
* Zone into {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} from {z:East Ronfaure (S)} (Survival Guide and telecrystal won't work).
* Return to {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)} and speak to {n:Erlene}.
* Zone into {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} from {z:Rolanberry Fields (S)} for cutscene.
* Examine the **Indescript Markings** targetable location in {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)} at the south eastern corner of (J-7) for a cutscene. You will receive {@k} {k:Ulbrecht's mortarboard}.
** The **Indescript Markings** disappear during {@g:Element: Earth|Earth} Dusty weather. They are located on the ledge in the southeastern part of the quadrant, near a ???.
* Return to {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)} and speak to Erlene for a cutscene that finishes the quest for your reward.

=2 Notes
After finishing this quest, you can commission the rest of your Artifact pieces from {q:Loussaire|Loussaire|Loussaire}, Bastok Markets (S) - (G-10).
=4 Artifact Trace
After finishing the quest Downward Helix, you may commission {p:Scholar} {i:Artifact Armor} from Loussaire while you are on Scholar. You can choose the order in which you receive the armor and may commission a new piece one game day after the last piece was completed. After starting the first piece, you may request subsequent pieces on any job.
* As of February 2026, you can only obtain the key items for the piece you have actively selected from Loussaire.
* You will receive your armor immediately, but must zone and wait for the game day to change to start the next piece.

